          "note": "ETF 7.2.4: the entity's cached first result when the property cannot update, else testEntityInternal (NBTProperty: the entity's NBT, the query)",
          "sha256": "62dbe6b13d5be640c502c0e2ba98bc6e73bcc9fe1bfed2f18854a2eb8acaad80"
        }
      ],
      "cancel": [],
      "conversion": "MixinExtras @WrapOperation of NBTProperty.testEntity(ETFEntityRenderState, boolean) in NBTMethod.nbtMethodStatic and NBTMethod.lambda$new$0 (EMF 3.3.9, require = 0): the first result per (NBTProperty, entity UUID) of the current client tick is reused by that tick's later calls (helper bons.furious.patch.emf_lean.EmfNbtTickMemo); shadow mode -Dbons_and_furious.emfNbtTickMemo.shadow=true",
      "license": "EMF and ETF are LGPL-3.0: no code of either is carried (the wrapper calls ETF's own testEntity or returns its earlier result)",
      "kind": "change"
    },
